WEBVTT

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.550
A FEW WEEKS AGO
IN THE KINGDOM OF THAILAND

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:16.010
WAT PHRA KAEW

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.430
<i>Nice to see you again.</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.140
It looks like your business is going well.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.210
RAMA XIII
RULER OF THE KINGDOM OF THAILAND

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:23.790
Thank you, Your Royal Highness.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.780
Our success in the Kingdom of Thailand...

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.770
TADASHI IIDA,
PRESIDENT OF YAZU TRADING

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.610
...was made possible
thanks to your patronage, sir.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:33.900
-We will never forget--
-Get straight to the point.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:39.830
You wouldn't ask for an audience with me
without an ulterior motive.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:41.910
Just tell me what you want.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.460
I appreciate your openness, sir.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:50.210
I would like to inform you
that we, Yazu Trading, will join

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:53.970
the Kengan Life-or-Death Tournament
to be held in two months.

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:58.180
We would be honored
if you could grace us with your support.

00:00:58.390 --> 00:00:59.430
Meaning...

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:03.100
Would you kindly permit us
to get the man standing next to you,

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:06.480
the Thai God of War,
as our company's affiliated fighter?

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:10.320
You want me to give you my trusty sword?

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:12.730
GAOLAN WONGSAWAT
A.K.A. "THE THAI GOD OF WAR"

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:13.940
For what in return?

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:19.870
Yazu Trading will grow bigger if I become
the chairman of the Kengan Association,

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:25.870
which will enable me to promise
more benefits to you, sir.

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:30.290
You mean I will gain nothing in return
if you fail to win, right?

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:33.420
You're as wily as usual.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.170
Did you hear that, Gaolan?

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:40.300
I like ambitious men like him.

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:43.430
Can you provide help to this man?

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:48.400
If it is your order,
I am pleased to fight.

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:55.490
For you, sir, and for the honor
of the Kingdom of Thailand,

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:59.200
<i>I swear to defeat my opponents.</i>

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:02.660
SAYAKA KATAHARA

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.240
<i>Let's welcome the fighters!</i>

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:06.790
GAME 15

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:10.830
<i>This man is finally appearing</i>
<i>on the fight stage.</i>

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:15.800
<i>He is probably the top of the big names</i>
<i>in this tournament!</i>

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:18.970
<i>A revolutionary in the boxing field,</i>

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:24.260
<i>he is the strongest boxer in history,</i>
<i>having won all four major championships.</i>

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:28.190
<i>Standing at 187 cm and weighing 91 kg,</i>

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:30.980
<i>he makes his kengan match debut today.</i>

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:36.320
<i>Representing Yazu Trading,</i>
<i>also known as the Thai God of War,</i>

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:39.700
<i>Gaolan Wongsawat!</i>

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:49.280
GAOLAN WONGSAWAT
REP. FIGHTER YAZU TRADING

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:50.460
Hey, what's she saying?

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:52.130
I'm a big name, too!

00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:53.500
NAOYA OHKUBO

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:56.550
It's no fun having no one
listen to me complaining.

00:02:57.090 --> 00:03:00.130
Lihito's gone somewhere
and Kaneda's having a match.

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:02.590
Himuro's disappeared, too.

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:06.930
I guess I should also go
prepare for my own game.

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:12.600
So, you're going?

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.230
RYO HIMURO

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:15.770
Yes, but don't worry.

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:18.740
I'll be all right.

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:22.070
<i>Next comes the opponent!</i>

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:27.450
<i>In the luxury cruise ship </i>The Kengan<i>,</i>
<i>there was a death match behind the scenes.</i>

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:30.830
Having defeated Ryo Himuro,
a.k.a. "the Icy Emperor,"

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.210
<i>this man obtained</i>
<i>his position as a fighter.</i>

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:36.880
<i>A genuinely skilled, promising fighter</i>
<i>is going to make</i>

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:39.920
<i>a sensational debut</i>
<i>after overpowering a superior!</i>

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:43.430
<i>Standing at 170 cm and weighing 73 kg,</i>

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:46.560
<i>he also makes</i>
<i>his kengan match debut today.</i>

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:51.230
Representing Ginokuniya Bookshop,
also known as the Giant Killer,

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:55.440
<i>Suekichi Kaneda!</i>

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:03.110
SUEKICHI KANEDA

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.950
Hi, nice to meet you.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:12.910
BOXING VS ANCIENT MARTIAL ARTS

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:47.930
"VOLITION"

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:54.270
<i>I was born as the second son</i>
<i>in the Kaneda family.</i>

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:59.230
<i>I have a brother and three big sisters.</i>

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:05.440
<i>Since childhood,</i>
<i>I haven't been very healthy.</i>

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:09.320
<i>Before I could remember,</i>

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:11.410
<i>I almost died twice.</i>

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:16.070
<i>By the time I was about</i>
<i>to enter elementary school,</i>

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.810
<i>I'd had four operations.</i>

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:22.670
<i>There was nothing special about me.</i>
<i>I was just born frail.</i>

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:31.010
<i>However, I had only one thing</i>
<i>that set me apart from others.</i>

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:32.760
<i>That is...</i>

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:37.430
<i>a craving for strength.</i>

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:44.270
I can start anytime. Come on.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:50.610
Please go easy on me.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:56.790
KEN OHYA

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:58.960
Wow, I didn't know you smoke a pipe.

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.250
Oh, Kazu.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.420
KAZUO YAMASHITA

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.710
Kaneda's game is finally about to begin.

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:07.010
Though we are opponents
in this tournament,

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:10.550
let's go drinking again
once everything's finished.

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:12.680
Whatever the result is.

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:16.810
Well, sorry to disturb you. Bye.

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:19.350
Wait, Kazu.

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:23.650
How can you be so nonchalant?

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.190
We have to start drinking right now!

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:29.900
Oh, Ken!
I knew you hadn't changed!

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:33.410
Are you talking about Toyo Electric Power?

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:37.700
It's true that Mr. Hayami asked me
to cooperate with him,

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:40.960
<i>or rather threatened me,</i>

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:47.460
but I'm not good
at obeying anybody's orders.

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:49.420
Wow.

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:50.880
It's no problem.

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:53.970
Unless he becomes
the chairman of the Kengan Association,

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:56.300
Hayami can never retaliate against me.

00:07:56.720 --> 00:08:00.180
I have more power
than you might imagine.

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:04.480
In other words, everything will be okay
if I become the champion.

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:07.230
That's my man, Ken.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:11.190
Well, to Kaneda's victory
in his first round.

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:12.950
Cheers!

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:16.990
<i>The game is about to begin.</i>

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:21.790
<i>Suekichi Kaneda is challenging</i>
<i>the god of boxing!</i>

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.750
<i>This tournament is just a show.</i>

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:28.340
<i>It's not a place for warriors to fight.</i>

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:30.510
<i>And this man is...</i>

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:32.570
<i>totally mediocre, nowhere near qualified</i>

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:35.890
-<i>even to be a part of this scene.</i>
-It's exciting to be here, isn't it?

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:38.340
<i>Even a man like him can be a fighter.</i>

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:41.180
<i>That tells me how low</i>
<i>the level of this tournament is.</i>

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:43.390
<i>All right.</i>

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:48.770
<i>For His Royal Highness Rama XIII</i>
<i>and the glory of my country,</i>

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:52.190
<i>I'm just going to crush every enemy</i>
<i>in my way.</i>

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:56.030
Are you two ready?

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.410
Fight!

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.040
<i>Now the 15th game has begun.</i>

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:07.330
<i>The heavyweight boxing champion</i>
<i>of the major four organizations,</i>

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:10.550
<i>Gaolan, is taking a stance</i>
<i>known as the Hitman Style.</i>

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:16.130
<i>Meanwhile, Kaneda is holding his palms</i>
<i>against Gaolan.</i>

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:20.060
<i>It's quite similar</i>
<i>to the </i>Maeba<i> stance of karate.</i>

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:21.510
JERRY TYSON

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:24.430
Jerry, tell us your thoughts
about how they compare.

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:27.480
Kaneda has made a sound judgment.

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:32.150
He's keeping watch for
Gaolan's fastest attack.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:34.570
A boxer's fastest attack is

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:38.780
<i>not straight punch nor uppercut.</i>

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:41.450
<i>It's not the hook, either.</i>

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.790
<i>The answer is jab.</i>

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:48.920
<i>Besides, Gaolan's jab is regarded</i>
<i>as the fastest among all boxers.</i>

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:50.790
It's called "Flash."

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:54.960
He launches a maximum of 13 jabs
in a single breath.

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.880
He's a hell of an extraordinary guy!

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:59.260
<i>Thirteen jabs?</i>

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:02.220
<i>Oh, please...</i>

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:05.520
<i>Don't back off, my body.</i>

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:10.610
<i>It's scared</i>
<i>and instinctively trying to escape.</i>

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:12.360
<i>How shameful.</i>

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:15.570
<i>Did Mr. Himuro give up the fight?</i>

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:18.780
<i>Did Lihito throw the game?</i>

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:20.870
<i>Never.</i>

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:23.990
<i>They fought till the end, right?</i>

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:27.960
<i>If it's not now, when do I go ahead?</i>

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:29.620
<i>He moved!</i>

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:33.000
<i>Kaneda is getting closer to Gaolan.</i>

00:10:34.550 --> 00:10:37.920
Look, he's finally gotten
within the reach of the boxer!

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:40.180
Hi, how are you?

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:45.140
I came because you didn't come to me.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:49.850
<i>That's it!</i>

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:52.150
<i>His specialty, flicker jabs!</i>

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:56.570
<i>As I thought, his jab is even faster</i>
<i>than the one used in boxing.</i>

00:10:57.530 --> 00:10:59.030
<i>This man...</i>

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:04.580
<i>In that split second,</i>
<i>he reacted to my move.</i>

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:08.910
Wow, you are as fast as I expected.

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:12.830
I failed to dislocate your wrist.

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:26.930
<i>Why? Even top-ranked boxers</i>
<i>can't follow my jab.</i>

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:30.190
<i>How could this mediocre one do it?</i>

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:35.060
A nosebleed...

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:39.400
That was such an incredible speed.

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:41.990
I couldn't do anything in response.

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:43.700
<i>Cheap trick.</i>

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:46.120
<i>I won't fall in your trap.</i>

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:48.910
<i>Suekichi Kaneda.</i>

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:05.140
KUJIN STYLE: CRESCENT SCYTHE

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:11.270
KUJIN STYLE: LEVER THROW

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:18.020
Gee, that was so close!

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:22.320
If you can go to the ground and grapple,
you'll gain the advantage over the boxer.

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.610
<i>What are they looking at, amateurs?</i>

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:27.580
<i>Any plan, Kaneda?</i>

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.080
<i>That jerk is perfectly prepared</i>
<i>for submission hold, too.</i>

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.210
<i>You won't win if you're one step behind.</i>

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:41.970
<i>Now's the time!</i>

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:47.930
<i>Here... I've got you.</i>

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:49.430
<i>That's it!</i>

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:51.810
<i>Even when you get a clean hit,</i>

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:56.060
<i>Kaneda avoids getting damaged</i>
<i>by slightly displacing the hit points.</i>

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:59.320
<i>It means he's adjusting to follow...</i>

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:02.070
<i>the opponent's attack!</i>

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:05.410
KUJIN
OVERTURNING HEAVEN/EARTH

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:06.910
<i>It worked!</i>

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:12.500
<i>From that unstable stance?</i>

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:16.170
<i>This data is unavailable</i>
<i>from boxing matches.</i>

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:18.500
<i>It's lucky I saw it early.</i>

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.630
His Flash comes again!

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:23.760
It's fast as hell!

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:26.970
<i>He's displacing the hit points,</i>

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:30.510
<i>though he shouldn't be able to see</i>
<i>my hitting move.</i>

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:35.850
<i>A counter!</i>

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.440
<i>Oh, man! He's ruthlessly beating him!</i>

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:44.110
<i>Just withstand it for now.</i>

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:47.280
<i>Oops! My foot...</i>

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:52.790
<i>A body blow gets stuck in straight!</i>

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:57.580
Kaneda collapses,
unable to absorb the attack!

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.130
<i>You were amazing.</i>

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.550
<i>Suekichi Kaneda.</i>

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:06.550
<i>Your courage deserves praise.</i>

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:10.470
Don't take me lightly, you prick.

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:11.850
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.640
You are the unified champion
in boxing, right?

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:18.730
And this is your fighting style?

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:21.860
Why didn't you continue attacking?

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:27.450
Only one more attack was needed
to make you the winner for sure.

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:29.910
Were you going easy on me?

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:33.240
Because I'm the weak one?

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.830
I've been a fan of you

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:40.880
since long before this match.

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:43.920
I repeatedly watched your matches.

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:48.050
No gloves, no shoes, and no rules.

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:54.220
Free from all the limitations, you can do
far more than this if you fight seriously!

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:56.810
You have a lot of spirit.

00:14:57.600 --> 00:14:59.810
But the result is now absolute.

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:04.070
I admire you, Suekichi Kaneda.

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:09.400
I'm happy to unexpectedly see
a true warrior like you.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:11.570
But...

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:15.830
there is a great wall standing between us.

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:20.830
-I don't want to kill--
-So you're taking me lightly!

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:24.540
I know well that I have no talent.

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:26.000
But...

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:29.090
it's the only thing I can do!

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:30.800
<i>This man...</i>

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:35.220
No one should judge me.

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:40.310
What's wrong with the weak
aiming to be the strong?!

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:42.190
<i>Kaneda...</i>

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:44.520
OHMA TOKITA
YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:47.280
<i>You finally showed your true colors.</i>

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:49.490
<i>It took too long.</i>

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:53.360
<i>I see now.</i>

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:57.700
<i>Among the fighters in this tournament,</i>
<i>he's the only one</i>

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:00.960
<i>who took over this tournament</i>
<i>as the weak one.</i>

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:05.000
<i>He fights to break away</i>
<i>from being weak.</i>

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.050
SAW PAING YOROIZUKA

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:10.300
You should respond to him!

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:13.050
Gaolan!

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:16.010
I know, I will.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:18.260
Sorry about that.

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:21.180
I didn't want to kill you.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:25.310
That's why I only used my techniques
suitable for the game.

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:27.730
I was wrong.

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:33.650
For whatever reason, it's true
that I showed mercy to you.

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:38.740
In a fight, feeling pity for the opponent
is the same as insulting him.

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:43.120
Every fighter must be put
on an equal footing in a fight.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.630
It seems my mind was full of arrogance.

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.460
I understand.

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:56.010
In honor of your fighting spirit,
I'll crush you with my full power.

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.300
Yeah!

00:16:59.430 --> 00:17:00.890
<i>Gaolan's mood has changed.</i>

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:02.230
<i>That jerk...</i>

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:05.650
<i>shifted from a boxer to a fighter!</i>

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:09.900
Thank you, Gaolan.

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:15.450
<i>Now...</i>

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:17.320
KUJIN
STANCE OF YIN-YANG INTERSECTION

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:19.030
<i>I can use the Foresight.</i>

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:26.250
<i>What I investigated and predicted was you</i>
<i>using full power, pulling off the gloves.</i>

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:28.460
<i>I tried everything.</i>

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:31.670
<i>Now, all I need to do</i>
<i>is to make minor adjustments.</i>

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:34.050
<i>I know.</i>

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:38.470
<i>Your strength is at a much higher level</i>
<i>than mine.</i>

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:41.390
<i>Once you go all out,</i>

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:44.930
<i>only a single attack could definitely</i>
<i>finish me off.</i>

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:47.650
<i>How excellent!</i>

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:51.270
<i>This is what I wanted.</i>

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:57.320
<i>Now, let's fight fairly!</i>

00:17:58.780 --> 00:17:59.740
FIRST ATTACK

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:03.490
SECOND ATTACK

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:07.670
THIRD ATTACK

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:10.080
FOURTH ATTACK

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:12.670
FIFTH AND SIXTH ATTACKS

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:17.630
SEVENTH ATTACK

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:19.010
EIGHTH ATTACK

00:18:19.390 --> 00:18:20.260
NINTH ATTACK

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:31.520
<i>It's... finished!</i>

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:35.860
<i>The one who won this game is</i>
<i>the world boxing champion!</i>

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:40.110
<i>Gaolan Wongsawat!</i>

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:42.490
<i>Suekichi Kaneda.</i>

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:45.160
<i>I fulfilled my promise.</i>

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:50.170
<i>Tenth attack... and checkmate.</i>

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:55.880
<i>I thought I could do a little more...</i>

00:18:58.090 --> 00:19:00.640
<i>Finishing with only ten attacks.</i>

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:03.600
<i>My overwhelming victory is</i>
<i>an unshakable fact.</i>

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:08.850
<i>But I went all out and you could still</i>
<i>resist me until my tenth attack.</i>

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:11.810
<i>It's incredible</i>
<i>because I'm superior to you in everything:</i>

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:15.690
<i>power, speed, and technique.</i>

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:18.570
<i>It was a good fight.</i>

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:21.360
<i>Sleep for now,</i>

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:22.870
<i>my friend.</i>

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.990
WINNER GAME 15: "THE THAI GOD OF WAR"
PROCEEDS TO SECOND ROUND

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:28.330
LOSER GAME 15: "THE GIANT KILLER"
ELIMINATED IN FIRST ROUND

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:33.830
Mr. Kaneda...

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:36.090
You didn't have to do this much.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:40.550
Before the game, I told him

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:42.550
to retire.

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:47.430
It's because I saw what was in his bag.

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:51.060
<i>It was like a trade show for pain pills.</i>

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:54.020
<i>He even had nerve block injections.</i>

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:57.860
Frankly speaking, I'm strong.

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:02.490
And from this strong man,
he won the right to be called a fighter.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:07.580
However, with his ordinary
physical capacity,

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:09.620
<i>he was also badly damaged in our battle.</i>

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:14.330
<i>Now I understand the reason</i>
<i>why my attacks began to fail.</i>

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:17.840
<i>Kaneda was analyzing.</i>

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:22.930
He predicted my attacks and
moved to a safe zone in advance.

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:27.350
I got too mad to detect his trick
during the battle.

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:33.940
But his method requires him to receive
all the attacks until finishing analyzing.

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:38.480
His fighting style is obviously
not for a tournament game.

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:43.900
I tried to stop him, telling him
he might die fighting in that condition.

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:46.530
But he said...

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:50.830
<i>No way, Mr. Himuro.</i>

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:54.500
<i>I am the one who beat Ryo Himuro.</i>

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:58.420
<i>Don't worry. I'm sure I'll win.</i>

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:02.630
You are extremely cool.

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:06.550
If I were a woman, I would kiss you.

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:09.510
Ken.

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:13.390
I'm sorry about Kaneda.

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:16.600
Well, I just have to accept it.

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:19.480
He put up a great fight against Gaolan.

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:22.070
You're so easygoing.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:24.950
Of course I'm feeling sorry, too,

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:28.990
but I could accomplish my minimum goal
at least.

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:30.280
Your goal?

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:36.500
Just joining this kind of game enables you
to show off the power of your company.

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:41.500
Same as the international sports games
countries use to show their flags.

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:43.130
Oh, I see.

00:21:43.590 --> 00:21:47.680
It's amazing enough that you can easily
pay five billion yen for the entry fee.

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:52.850
As a result, I got four new businesses
after arriving on the island

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:56.600
which will soon cover the cost
of five billion yen.

00:21:56.770 --> 00:21:58.310
Seriously?

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:02.860
But honestly, I was aiming
to be the champion.

00:22:03.530 --> 00:22:06.570
Himuro was the strongest fighter
in our company's history.

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:09.910
Then Kaneda won against Himuro.

00:22:10.570 --> 00:22:14.250
Those two made me dream of a good future.

00:22:14.830 --> 00:22:18.460
I think I might be jealous of them.

00:22:18.790 --> 00:22:22.000
They're the opposite of people like us,
full of calculations,

00:22:22.380 --> 00:22:25.710
they just crave pure strength.

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:27.840
Ken...

00:22:30.050 --> 00:22:32.890
We still have a good future!

00:22:33.220 --> 00:22:34.100
Right!

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:06.940
PREVIEW

00:24:07.020 --> 00:24:10.110
<i>The King of Combat,</i>
<i>the living legend, comes in.</i>

00:24:10.490 --> 00:24:12.070
<i>Fang of Metsudo,</i>

00:24:12.280 --> 00:24:14.450
<i>the overwhelming emperor, shows up.</i>

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:16.200
<i>A giant clash of two great kings.</i>

00:24:16.620 --> 00:24:18.580
<i>Both of them are as powerful</i>
<i>as the final boss!</i>

00:24:19.080 --> 00:24:20.330
<i>Next episode: "Champions."</i>

00:24:20.410 --> 00:24:21.870
Subtitle translation by Hinako Someno
